      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Would like to leave a post as well.\n\nTried helping.\n\nHad Luna clear/delete all files in Appdata for VRChat.\nReset VRChat back to where it is brand new (Regedit...ect from discord tutorial), and had her verify files on steam.\n\nEven made sure the ports where forwarded and Nat type was open.\n(still nothing).\n\nIt seems to be a problem with 120-150MB+ worlds or where it stalls out after 2 minutes,\n\nnoticed if you have slow internet, it just fails on you instead of letting you download the full world(as if their is a timer for how long you can be downloading) or load anything before kicking you out.\n\nWanted to note this for Devs.\n\nProblem also persisted in my world \"Kami's Lookout\".\n\nwhich is 149MB.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
